      "content": "wait, i meant the stuff happening in tbilisi lately, like the protests about the foreign agent law. i'm not talking about the breakaway regions, i mean the domestic groups here. like, between the ones siding with the gov and the ones protesting in the streets, which ones are the \"moderates\" and which ones are the \"extremists\" i should avoid?",
